*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0006
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 692
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0006.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0006C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM AGE-FEE-RULES
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
AGE-FEE-RULES.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN STUDENT-IND = 'Y' AND CUSTOMER-AGE LESS THAN 25
            MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN CUSTOMER-AGE NOT LESS THAN 60
            MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 4 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
